cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SIAV-VariantFlow in your research, please cite this software and the relevant associated publication."
title: "SIAV-VariantFlow"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "López-Valiñas"
    given-names: "Álvaro"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7492-5108"

repository-code: "https://github.com/alvarolva/SIAV-VariantFlow"

abstract: >-
  A reproducible bioinformatics workflow for low-frequency
  intrahost variant detection, annotation and coverage analysis
  in swine influenza A virus from Illumina paired-end sequencing data.

keywords:
  - influenza A virus
  - swine influenza
  - viral genomics
  - intrahost variation
  - variant calling
  - LoFreq
  - Illumina
